    "reference":  "DL-91196",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our\u003cstrong\u003e floor lamp\u003c/strong\u003e, the ultimate solution to illuminate your home or business in an efficient and durable way. Made with cutting-edge and environmentally friendly materials, this floor lamp adapts elegantly to any environment and decorating style, making it the ideal choice for any space, reduce your expenses, save energy and contribute to the conservation of the environment and your surroundings!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e living room lamp\u003c/strong\u003e does NOT include bulb, to check our E27 bulbs please click on the button:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.factorled.com/en/130-e27-led-bulbs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE27 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eFloor Lamp - HORSENS - for E27 LED\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e LED Floor Lamp  \u003c/strong\u003ehas a simple design that brings a touch of distinction to the room.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdvantages of our floor lamp: \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficient and Eco-Friendly Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Our floor lamp has been designed to make the most of LED technology, which not only consumes less energy but also lasts far longer. That means you will not just be saving money on your electricity bill, you will also be helping to look after the planet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCutting-Edge Design:\u003c/strong\u003e The design of our floor lamp is a masterpiece of styling and sophistication. Its minimalist structure fits perfectly into any decorating scheme, from contemporary to classic. The quality of its materials and its solid build ensure that this lamp is not only a light source but also a piece of art that enhances the look of your home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Functionality:\u003c/strong\u003e This lamp is far more than a lighting accessory. Use it next to your sofa or your reading armchair for comfortable reading, at your desk to boost your productivity or in the living room as a unique conversation piece. It is also ideal for highlighting artwork, plants or any decorative feature you want to bring out.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere You Can Use It:\u003c/strong\u003e Picture the\u003cstrong\u003e floor lamp \u003c/strong\u003efor \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e LED in your bedroom, creating a relaxing, welcoming atmosphere for your reading nights. Think about how it will light your workspace, improving your focus and increasing your productivity. It is also perfect for adding a touch of style to your living room or dining room. This lamp is the versatile solution you have been looking for to light up and beautify any corner of your home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo not let the chance to improve your quality of life and your decor pass you by. Click \"Buy Now\" and take home the floor lamp for E27 LED that will elevate your spaces and turn your everyday moments into exceptional experiences!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we are committed to making our products QUALITY products that provide everything needed for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product. \u003c/p\u003e",
